# Intel GPUs and NPUs on Linux through ONNX Runtime's OpenVINO plugin (linux-x86_64-cpu
# only): the ONNX exporter, the runtime the plugin registers into, and the plugin with its
# own OpenVINO runtime. A GPU appears only where the host has Intel's compute driver.
# ONNX Runtime finds an NPU on Linux only from 1.28 on (it reads /sys/class/accel).
